+stochastic `6 × 6` matrix; for `k ≥ 1`,
+`K_k(a_1, …, a_k) = Σ_s Π_{i=1}^k K(a_i, s)`, so `K_1 ≡ 1`, `K_2(a, b) = (K^2)(a, b)`
+(block 02's E1), and `K_3` is a symmetric three-index array. The `k`-neighbor
